Prior art
---------

Octo's local library follows approaches worked out by other open-source
music players, reimplemented here:

- Auxio (GPL-3.0): grouping albums by name and splitting a group only
  when every track names its album artist or release; reading tags from
  the files themselves and caching them by modified time.
- Gramophone (GPL-3.0): track numbers from file names when tags have none.
